function appCards(){return state.apps.sort((a,b)=>a.sortOrder-b.sortOrder).map(a=>`<article class="app-card"><div class="app-card-top"><span class="app-icon">${a.available?'◇':'□'}</span><button class="favorite mini ${isFav('app',a.id)?'active':''}" onclick="toggleFavorite('app','${a.id}','','')" aria-label="お気に入り切替">${isFav('app',a.id)?'★':'☆'}</button></div><h3>${esc(a.name)}</h3><p class="sub">${esc(a.subtitle)}</p><p>${esc(a.description)}</p><dl><dt>状態</dt><dd>${a.available?'利用可能':'今後追加予定'}</dd><dt>URL</dt><dd>${a.url?esc(a.url):'未登録'}</dd><dt>最終閲覧</dt><dd>${esc(a.lastOpenedAt)||'なし'}</dd></dl><div class="app-actions"><button ${!a.available?'disabled':''} onclick="openApp('${a.id}')">開く</button><button class="secondary" onclick="editApp('${a.id}')">URL登録</button></div></article>`).join('')}
